# Only the website goes to GitHub. Everything else in this folder
# (Font, Goodreads, backups, notes, data, Claude outputs) stays on the PC.
# Everything is ignored first, then the site files are let back in.
# A new top-level file or folder for the site must be added below.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/admin.html
!/favicon.ico
!/manifest.webmanifest
!/sw.js
!/css/
!/js/
!/icons/
!/supabase/
